{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01HveoeveXari3BJ4YEy12Lj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"US-055 committed. Summary:\n\n**What was implemented:**\n- `src/lib/lessonChat/inflight.ts` — module-level `Map<requestId, AbortController>` registry with register/abort/cleanup helpers.\n- `Connector.chatStream(req, signal)` added to both subprocess and SDK paths — subprocess spawns `claude -p` (raw streaming) and forwards stdout line-by-line as `token` events; SDK iterates `query()` and emits each text block. Both honour `signal.aborted` (subprocess SIGTERM→SIGKILL, SDK iterator break).\n- POST `/api/lesson-chat` now branches on `Accept: text/event-stream`, returns a `ReadableStream` SSE response with first event `meta {requestId}`, then per-token frames, then `done`. The stream's `cancel` callback also aborts on client disconnect.\n- DELETE `/api/lesson-chat/[requestId]` aborts the in-flight controller (204) or returns 404.\n- `LessonChat.tsx` client uses fetch + `getReader()`, parses SSE frames, accumulates tokens into the bubble in real time. Stop button is now active during streaming → both `ac.abort()` and DELETE fire; bubble freezes the partial text and renders an italic `— stopped by user` block-line in `--text-tertiary`. TypingDots' inline keyframes hoisted out of the bubble so they don't pollute textContent.\n\n**Quality:** typecheck clean; 209/209 tests (added 9); lint baseline unchanged (162/24 = US-054 baseline minus 1 stale eslint-disable). Browser test 12/12 against real `claude -p`: tokens stream in (1095 chars before stop), Stop preserves partial text + suffix (1113 chars total), follow-up question replies normally. Screenshot at `/tmp/US-055-after-stop.png`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":564,"cache_read_input_tokens":183844,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":564},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"af09fd90-aa43-4e2e-8fd9-839962b1c817","uuid":"659882cc-3fc8-406d-a241-0ec05b87a628"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":1131339,"duration_api_ms":963204,"num_turns":112,"result":"US-055 committed. Summary:\n\n**What was implemented:**\n- `src/lib/lessonChat/inflight.ts` — module-level `Map<requestId, AbortController>` registry with register/abort/cleanup helpers.\n- `Connector.chatStream(req, signal)` added to both subprocess and SDK paths — subprocess spawns `claude -p` (raw streaming) and forwards stdout line-by-line as `token` events; SDK iterates `query()` and emits each text block. Both honour `signal.aborted` (subprocess SIGTERM→SIGKILL, SDK iterator break).\n- POST `/api/lesson-chat` now branches on `Accept: text/event-stream`, returns a `ReadableStream` SSE response with first event `meta {requestId}`, then per-token frames, then `done`. The stream's `cancel` callback also aborts on client disconnect.\n- DELETE `/api/lesson-chat/[requestId]` aborts the in-flight controller (204) or returns 404.\n- `LessonChat.tsx` client uses fetch + `getReader()`, parses SSE frames, accumulates tokens into the bubble in real time. Stop button is now active during streaming → both `ac.abort()` and DELETE fire; bubble freezes the partial text and renders an italic `— stopped by user` block-line in `--text-tertiary`. TypingDots' inline keyframes hoisted out of the bubble so they don't pollute textContent.\n\n**Quality:** typecheck clean; 209/209 tests (added 9); lint baseline unchanged (162/24 = US-054 baseline minus 1 stale eslint-disable). Browser test 12/12 against real `claude -p`: tokens stream in (1095 chars before stop), Stop preserves partial text + suffix (1113 chars total), follow-up question replies normally. Screenshot at `/tmp/US-055-after-stop.png`.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"af09fd90-aa43-4e2e-8fd9-839962b1c817","total_cost_usd":10.223881250000005,"usage":{"input_tokens":122,"cache_creation_input_tokens":239091,"cache_read_input_tokens":13853587,"output_tokens":71910,"server_t